#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/uefi-bootloaders/grub-efi.xml:133
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"First, install font data as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Primeiro, instale os dados da fonte como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/uefi-bootloaders/grub-efi.xml:137
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir -pv /usr/share/fonts/unifont &amp;&amp;\n"
"gunzip -c ../unifont-&unifont-version;.pcf.gz > /usr/share/fonts/unifont/unifont.pcf</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir -pv /usr/share/fonts/unifont &amp;&amp;\n"
"gunzip -c ../unifont-&unifont-version;.pcf.gz > /usr/share/fonts/unifont/unifont.pcf</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><warning><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/uefi-bootloaders/grub-efi.xml:141
#, xml-text
msgid "Unset any environment variables which may affect the build:"
msgstr ""
"Desconfigure quaisquer variáveis de ambiente que possivelmente afetem a "
"construção:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><warning><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/uefi-bootloaders/grub-efi.xml:143
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>unset {C,CPP,CXX,LD}FLAGS</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>unset {C,CPP,CXX,LD}FLAGS</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><warning><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/uefi-bootloaders/grub-efi.xml:145
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Don't try <quote>tuning</quote> this package with custom compilation flags: "
"this package is a bootloader, with low-level operations in the source code "
"which is likely to be broken by some aggressive optimizations."
msgstr ""
"Não tente <quote>ajustar</quote> esse pacote com sinalizadores "
"personalizados de compilação: esse pacote é um carregador de inicialização, "
"com operações de baixo nível no código-fonte, as quais provavelmente sejam "
"quebradas por algumas otimizações agressivas."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/uefi-bootloaders/grub-efi.xml:152
#, xml-text
msgid "Add a file missing from the release tarball:"
msgstr "Adicionar um arquivo ausente proveniente do tarball de lançamento:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/uefi-bootloaders/grub-efi.xml:155
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>echo <literal>depends bli part_gpt</literal> > grub-"
"core/extra_deps.lst</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>echo <literal>depends bli part_gpt</literal> > grub-core/"
"extra_deps.lst</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/uefi-bootloaders/grub-efi.xml:157
#, xml-text
msgid "If you are running a 32-bit LFS, prepare a 64-bit compiler:"
msgstr ""
"Se você estiver executando um LFS de 32 bits, [então] prepare um compilador "
"de 64 bits:"

#.  'literal' is used deliberately to show this is only for 32-bit LFS
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/uefi-bootloaders/grub-efi.xml:160
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>case $(uname -m) in i?86 )\n"
"    <literal>tar xf ../gcc-&gcc-version;.tar.xz\n"
"    mkdir gcc-&gcc-version;/build\n"
"    pushd gcc-&gcc-version;/build\n"
"        ../configure --prefix=$PWD/../../x86_64-gcc \\\n"
"                     --target=x86_64-linux-gnu      \\\n"
"                     --with-system-zlib             \\\n"
"                     --enable-languages=c,c++       \\\n"
"                     --with-ld=/usr/bin/ld\n"
"        make all-gcc\n"
"        make install-gcc\n"
"    popd\n"
"    export TARGET_CC=$PWD/x86_64-gcc/bin/x86_64-linux-gnu-gcc</literal>\n"
"esac</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>case $(uname -m) in i?86 )\n"
"    <literal>tar xf ../gcc-&gcc-version;.tar.xz\n"
"    mkdir gcc-&gcc-version;/build\n"
"    pushd gcc-&gcc-version;/build\n"
"        ../configure --prefix=$PWD/../../x86_64-gcc \\\n"
"                     --target=x86_64-linux-gnu      \\\n"
"                     --with-system-zlib             \\\n"
"                     --enable-languages=c,c++       \\\n"
"                     --with-ld=/usr/bin/ld\n"
"        make all-gcc\n"
"        make install-gcc\n"
"    popd\n"
"    export TARGET_CC=$PWD/x86_64-gcc/bin/x86_64-linux-gnu-gcc</literal>\n"
"esac</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/uefi-bootloaders/grub-efi.xml:176
#, xml-text
msgid "Build <application>GRUB</application> with the following commands:"
msgstr "Construa o <application>GRUB</application> com os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/uefi-bootloaders/grub-efi.xml:179
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr        \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc    \\\n"
"            --disable-efiemu     \\\n"
"            --enable-grub-mkfont \\\n"
"            --with-platform=efi  \\\n"
"            --target=x86_64      \\\n"
"            --disable-werror     &amp;&amp;\n"
"unset TARGET_CC &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr        \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc    \\\n"
"            --disable-efiemu     \\\n"
"            --enable-grub-mkfont \\\n"
"            --with-platform=efi  \\\n"
"            --target=x86_64      \\\n"
"            --disable-werror     &amp;&amp;\n"
"unset TARGET_CC &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/uefi-bootloaders/grub-efi.xml:190
#, xml-text
msgid "This package does not have a test suite providing meaningful results."
msgstr ""
"Esse pacote não tem uma suíte de teste que forneça resultados "
"significativos."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/uefi-bootloaders/grub-efi.xml:194
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/uefi-bootloaders/grub-efi.xml:197
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"mv -v /etc/bash_completion.d/grub /usr/share/bash-completion/completions</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"mv -v /etc/bash_completion.d/grub /usr/share/bash-completion/completions</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/uefi-bootloaders/grub-efi.xml:203
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/uefi-bootloaders/grub-efi.xml:206
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-grub-mkfont</parameter>: Build the tool named "
"<command>grub-mkfont</command> to generate the font file for the boot loader"
" from the font data we've installed."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-grub-mkfont</parameter>: Construa a ferramenta chamada "
"<command>grub-mkfont</command> para gerar o arquivo de fonte para o "
"carregador de inicialização a partir dos dados de fonte que instalamos."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><warning><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/uefi-bootloaders/grub-efi.xml:212
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If the recommended dependency <xref linkend=\"freetype2\"/> is not "
"installed, it is possible to omit this option and build GRUB.  However, if "
"<command>grub-mkfont</command> is not built, or the unicode font data is not"
" available at the time GRUB is built, GRUB won't install any font for the "
"boot loader.  The GRUB boot menu will be displayed using a coarse font or in"
" a smaller region on the screen."
msgstr ""
"Se a dependência recomendada <xref linkend=\"freetype2\"/> não estiver "
"instalada, é possível omitir essa opção e construir o GRUB. No entanto, se "
"<command>grub-mkfont</command> não for construído ou os dados da fonte "
"Unicode não estiverem disponíveis ao tempo que o GRUB for construído, o GRUB"
" não instalaria nenhuma fonte para o carregador de inicialização. O menu de "
"inicialização do GRUB será exibido usando uma fonte grosseira ou em uma "
"região menor na tela."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/uefi-bootloaders/grub-efi.xml:221
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-platform=efi</parameter>: Ensures building GRUB with EFI "
"enabled."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-platform=efi</parameter>: Garante a construção do GRUB com"
" EFI habilitado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/uefi-bootloaders/grub-efi.xml:226
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--target=x86_64</parameter>: Ensures building GRUB for x86_64 "
"even if building on a 32-bit LFS system.  Most EFI firmware on x86_64 does "
"not support 32-bit bootloaders."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--target=x86_64</parameter>: Garante a construção do GRUB para "
"x86_64, mesmo se construir em um sistema LFS de 32 bits. A maioria do "
"firmware EFI em x86_64 não suporta carregadores de inicialização de 32 bits."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/uefi-bootloaders/grub-efi.xml:232
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--target=i386</option>: A few 32-bit x86 platforms have EFI support."
"  And, some x86_64 platforms have a 32-bit EFI implementation, but they are "
"very old and rare. Use this instead of "
"<parameter>--target=x86_64</parameter> if you are <emphasis "
"role='bold'>absolutely sure</emphasis> that LFS is running on such a system."
msgstr ""
"<option>--target=i386</option>: Algumas plataformas x86 de 32 bits tem "
"suporte EFI. E algumas plataformas x86_64 tem uma implementação EFI de 32 "
"bits, mas são muito antigas e raras. Use isso ao invés de "
"<parameter>--target=x86_64</parameter> se você estiver <emphasis "
"role='bold'>absolutamente seguro(a)</emphasis> de que o LFS está executando "
"em tal sistema."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/uefi-bootloaders/grub-efi.xml:243
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring GRUB"
msgstr "Configurando o GRUB"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/uefi-bootloaders/grub-efi.xml:246
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Using GRUB to make the LFS system bootable on UEFI platform will be "
"discussed in <xref linkend=\"grub-setup\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Usar o GRUB para tornar o sistema LFS inicializável na plataforma UEFI será "
"discutido em <xref linkend=\"grub-setup\"/>."

